sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as AdminUI
    participant Saga
    participant CS as ComplianceService
    participant EB as EventBus

    UI->>Saga: initiateAudit(scope)
    Saga->>CS: collectComplianceData(scope)
    CS-->>Saga: auditData
    
    Saga->>CS: generateReport(auditData)
    CS-->>Saga: reportLink
    
    Saga->>EB: publish(AuditCompletedEvent)
    Saga->>UI: reportReady(reportLink)
